# Track only the workspace-root lockfile: EAS picks its package manager from the
# lockfile at the workspace root, and with none it falls back to yarn, which
# aborts on "packageManager": "npm@...". Member lockfiles stay ignored
# (api/package-lock.json was tracked before this rule and stays tracked for Render).
